# GSAP choreography

One timeline owns the sequence. Inert DOM with `data-*` attributes. GSAP lives in one `useGSAP` file.

- Labels name user actions (`heroReveal`, `workPin`), not CSS properties.
- Position with `"label+=0.12"`, never raw absolute seconds for scene coupling.
- `autoAlpha` not `opacity`. Transforms not `top`/`left`.
- Measure targets from DOM (`getBoundingClientRect`) — do not hardcode coordinates.
- `gsap.set` initial states at time 0. Reset block if the timeline loops.
- Stagger 0.05–0.08s for related items. Breathing room 0.8–1.5s after major beats.
- Reduced motion: skip timeline, show static rest, keep controls from crashing.